B.bSB=new A.kA("ping","A tool-connection test bench. Call it with an `action` to verify one execution path at a time: `ok` echoes your message back (always succeeds); `fail` fails on purpose (you get an error message to read); `error` fails like a storage outage; `throw` crashes on purpose (you get a generic failure); `long` returns a very long result. Only call this when the user asks you to verify tools or check the connection.",B.bEf,!0,!1,!1,B.i4)
